sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant U as Program (user)
    participant V as Program (vital code)
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant TM as Track Model
    Note over W,V: Inside TrackController.scan (UC-09).
    W->>U: scan(image)
    U-->>W: return XING_c
    W->>V: scan(image + XING_c)
    V->>V: scan internal: OUT_XING_c := XING_c OR OCC of crossing_approach(c)
    V-->>W: return OUT_XING_c
    W->>W: encode_outputs internal: crossing_commands[c] := OUT_XING_c
    W-->>M: read crossing_commands
    M->>M: _outputs internal: keyed by BlockKey
    M-->>H: return TrackModelOutputs.crossing_commands
    H->>H: _finish_tick internal: next tick, inputs_for(): track_controller_to_track_model(...)
    H->>TM: STEP: lights and gates
    TM-->>H: return the crossing state, read back next tick (UC-12)
